+# P23 third-party tool versions (interop record)
+
+Each pinned version P23 relies on, where the pin lives and how it was checked. Names and flags
+were checked against each tool's own documentation or `--help` at that version, never against the
+reference. Slices add their rows; the lead merges them at integration.
+
+| Tool | Version | Pinned in | Checked | Task |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| hatchling (build backend) | 1.32.4 | `pyproject.toml` `[build-system]` | the version uv resolved under `exclude-newer = 2026-10-04`; custom build hook API (`BuildHookInterface.initialize(version, build_data)`, `target_name`, editable builds arrive as target `wheel` version `editable`) exercised by `uv build --wheel` and `uv sync` | P23-01 |
+| uv (bootstrap) | 0.11.32 | `scripts/install/pins.json` | the uv on this machine (`uv --version`); flags used by install.sh checked with its `--help`: `python find --no-project <request>`, `python install --no-bin <version>`, `sync --directory --frozen --no-dev --python --extra`; env `UV_NO_CONFIG`, `UV_PYTHON_INSTALL_DIR`. Archive digests **not recorded yet** (no network in the build sandbox): `pins.json` is `provisional` until `pins.py update` runs | P23-02, P23-05 |
+| uv release asset names | `uv-<rust target triple>.tar.gz` (`.zip` on Windows) | `scripts/install/pins.py` | upstream naming convention; confirm when `pins.py update` downloads them | P23-02 |
+| Git for Windows (portable) | 2.51.0.windows.1 | `scripts/install/pins.json` | asset name `PortableGit-<X.Y.Z>[.<N>]-<64-bit|arm64>.7z.exe`; **to confirm** (version and the arm64 asset) when `pins.py update` runs with network | P23-02 |
+| Python (provisioned) | 3.14 (floor 3.13) | `scripts/install/pins.json` | matches `requires-python = ">=3.13,<3.15"` | P23-02, P23-05 |
+| curl exit codes | 5, 6, 7, 18, 22, 28, 52, 55, 56 | `scripts/install/sh/20-runtime.sh` | curl's documented exit codes: proxy/host resolution, connect, partial file, HTTP error with `-f`, timeout, empty reply, send/receive failure | P23-05 |
+| git | any with `clone --filter=blob:none`, `merge-base --is-ancestor`, `stash push --include-untracked -m` | — | git 2.x documentation; tests run the real git of the machine | P23-04 |
